{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-07",
  "title": "Fury of the Silent-2",
  "storyCode": "7-9",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bedfb80936ee019f6ac147a052658acc5a7b287b790821f367f3dd3eee2b58d2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chernobog Warehouse 12:40 A.M."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "With all these warehouses and storage equipment... this must be the warehouse district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "If we stay on this path, we'll reach the central district."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya! Come look! In the warehouse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What is it? ...Oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Signs of combat using sharp, blade-type Arts. Made quick work of three Reunion guys, tossed them over here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...still going."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Um, I'm asking you and the medic operators to take care of the Reunion people. They may have important information."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "And we've picked up Madame Ch'en's trail here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Bloodstains. She's hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "There's a trail of blood here, but it stops over there. She got her bleeding under control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Only one person left the scene. It must be Madame Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Hold on, Madame Ch'en. We're coming..."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "We're doing this again?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Feels like déjà vu.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Hah... Yeah, Chernobog was just like this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But Madame Ch'en was able to take on a rogue Reunion team all by herself back there..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "This time, it's totally different."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We had a cooperation agreement then, nothing else. I was only starting to learn who Madame Ch'en was..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But here, we're already..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Is that... a civilian?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...Where did she come from? We haven't found their hideout..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "This is an Ursus graveyard!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(Stay alert... but hold your fire!)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We're a neutral group researching the Infected! Ma'am,  we're here to help you!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We mean you no harm, you're a regular Infected—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Infected? Pfah! I'm Ursus!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You want to help the Infected...?! Hah, bullshit... Don't you know what you Infected have done to us?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Ma'am, we'll keep our distance if you feel unsafe. We'll stay twenty meters back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "No, no, I'm Infected too. So I'm not supposed to talk to you like that, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You'll save the Infected? Ahaha, hahaha... All Infected should all just die!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I should die too. I should die too! If there were no Infected, I wouldn't have gotten Infected!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "All they think about is revenge and hurting others... Is THAT what the Infected do? Is that what I should be doing?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rosmontis",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "(Amiya, comfort her, okay?)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(No. Not now.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(Let her vent. All the painful memories she's built up over the last month are stabbing into her consciousness.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(It's time she... faces them. This is a chance for her to pull them all out.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Do you know who we are here, Infected?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Infected, just like you. Alive and dead."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Infected who managed to just barely keep themselves alive, thanks to Reunion; and the countless Infected who died here, thanks to Reunion..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But we weren't Infected before."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "They scattered the people of Chernobog in all directions, then hunted us down. It started as a slaughter, then turned to torture, and finally they dumped the survivors like trash!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I don't even know how many starved or froze to death..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "But those of us who survived were all Infected by constant exposure to Originium! Every last one of us!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You Infected..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "You damn Infected...!!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Trust us... You don't have to take us to the other patients. We'll leave you what you need for critical care. And then we're gone."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I don't trust you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ursus Infected",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_057",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Did Ursus send you? Or Lungmen?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "If it really was them, we'd be dead already."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It's you...!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Amiya, scan his ID code."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Guard, explain yourself."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It's been a while, Amiya, Dr. Kal'tsit."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "And, Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
